{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1ebdfca1a773e2572c38979a4124adcff029a3cf3351cab0793e7b466981bcf8",
      "text": "It's no good. We're completely\nstuck in the ditch...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "8": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:71563ba99f01b317b5a3ab876ad97c439f518b0c06c4e27c51f6896f41761924",
      "text": "If only Nimbus were here...\nWe're so close to the village, too—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8f306bea1edc53350be2506221096c84d6e3fa0b578129b8c7ac35e3711db0d1",
      "text": "Oh my.\nAre you in some trouble?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "18": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:23b52391785d04a7c9def3c997799071cb484d9c665886af2b98b550abdcf632",
      "text": "If you like, leave it to me,\nPenelone. Won't you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "23": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4e07c5c051a26d405a2ef0f8b3e554dc98e766d084882fac732aa49310cd2da4",
      "text": "Ah, wait...! It might collapse, so\nyou'd better not get close—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "27": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b64123d16340b90476e36fd166406a280dd5aa4b71002a649700d786909f1ae5",
      "text": "Hee hee, don't you worry. I shall\nhelp you with my power, you'll see.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "31": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e0ad4c71371895413b09f3a25cfd830c99da64de4275ffbbe4e7c5514974aacd",
      "text": "W-what...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "35": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8559de3beab9bfab5a87bdb6e5001a38aa5204462f8057321fd4aa85c672991c",
      "text": "How was that? With my power,\nsomething like this is easy.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "40": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8cba68f3b3d94c18570c0524d2839557f1928760d01fc275575881575efe5f2e",
      "text": "Thank you! You saved us...!\nThat's some power you have, huh?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "44": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fabc543b642ff49cf15948f4d21a96610fc66e06c8fd3555240d82c9ce912501",
      "text": "Hee hee hee, oh, it's nothing! I'm\naiming to be a wonderful grown-up.\nI only did what any one would—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "49": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ac92eb2fe8ce0e411a9e407de3284dd9a1b3a2b1763e350da98842f9eb5beac3",
      "text": "...Nn... nya...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "54": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:63af79803d3de2f8c3cef67926842017e6a6a8f1a2c68ecc56af7e7047ff4316",
      "text": "Nyaaah~!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "58": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e5f6b7aee56ba5c46aee3f7e23a263cfd34cb55a65569ac779adbf7c78887f63",
      "text": "Nya nya...!\nNya nya nyaaah~!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "62": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0cd65ee855be40639c04d33a9f818bc3693c396da56f21751f7089eccc6b5f15",
      "text": "Um...\nY-you like balls, huh?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "67": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c1260ac95625da1742b1de798491d72c9e3daae793ed0d7a507123b00ed05fb0",
      "text": "N-no, you see, that's not it...!\nI am certainly not interested in such\nchildish things!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "70": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5152aaacd526a415b48f66584a4cd7c08e62c5d087be1f740e18083253ac9ccb",
      "text": "Huh? N-no, it's less childish and\nmore cat-like. I was kind of\nsurprised, actually—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "75": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:541c85e3549100cff4b7d3c86ca7e73ed02f17f3a7e49debaac94d57d80e03a5",
      "text": "L-look! I can do this, too!\nI'm no child, you see!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "79": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4dbaf07d04e7c5da0300935f275df968ac664b8975828395aabc1feab8b9ae81",
      "text": "Whoa, whoa, whoa...!!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "84": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7ee13030e0863203c5c3b62050a082086a362ebb64dfae868f2d00fb91685cfd",
      "text": "G-got it! We get it!\nJust put everything down for now!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "90": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3e5322a13721cde9ddbb9952c3965cb1ca8220b01481f9a5794331ce5880f2b3",
      "text": "Um... thank you again, Penelone.\nThanks to you, we finished our job\nsafely.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "94": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0085b7662fa8d6710cd1c559225e4ed56968d46d9adcb72105e1b8d4366434ab",
      "text": "I'm glad I could be of use. You\nmust be tired from your long\ntrip, so please rest easy...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "99": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4f1af35e8751536499aea5a3bdede403ef539fa6d778706c4af8940261282e70",
      "text": "...Still, nobody seems to be home.\nYour parents...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "102": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a3a71363d30176414cdd2e8468983acc675e5e7352fc11e56d6ae8fef2a8cd42",
      "text": "We live together. But Father and\nMother are very busy with their\nsocial welfare work.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "106": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1cc40b028a08bf7cf48b5d91216da2e1fe5084220199b9fda85d24c4bae0fb01",
      "text": "Food aid, infrastructure repairs,\nconflict mediation... They do so\nmany splendid jobs!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "111": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4698b35098cb80c82bc8fee08ea4661a59a7de2316a492639bdf91043a22475c",
      "text": "...I see.\nYou respect your parents, don't you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "114": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d177457e574a381cf9b16768e7a4722a385062119f515efe359e42c9e1bce292",
      "text": "But waiting alone for them to come\nhome... doesn't that feel lonely?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "119": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:baed97abf2dc2fccfda6577e0446238c80985f332d62523be3d651ccf61602e2",
      "text": "No, not at all! A wonderful grown-up\ndoesn't depend on anyone and can do\nanything alone—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:474f53dbbe1f7079e81f4b164aa02c2c29b393c61716d581dbca39fb562671b6",
      "text": "Pene? Is someone there?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "126": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f20988c2eaaa28964cc746cebcf20bbc4971b8a1bcb36971de0d99a9f26e7f80",
      "text": "Father! Mother!\nWelcome home!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "130": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a3f19782c7ebed231d4db9f1514785b8129ba01fac639313121c73fe9adfa6d5",
      "text": "Sorry for barging in... We came to\nthis village for work, and she helped\nus on the way.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "132": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e3a62975e72f9a2d9688a9e0b0824462f23cd2aba65d7426ebb5d88cdf5143b6",
      "text": "Oh my... is that so? Perhaps with\nthat strange power of hers—?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "135": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:eb55049d31ce2ab498299028bc402ffea0219db95fb192d95fc192e7d9de7dcd",
      "text": "Is your work done, both of you?\nWon't you be going out again today?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "137": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2582d719a46cbf37ad9f6ba5f50176ddbaf5e8bcfacf34650643972286916727",
      "text": "Yes, today we're fine. What do you\nwant to play? You said you wanted to\nread a picture book the other day.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "140": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b2ef97c80523cd76a4672f5c029142479fbc7443b68be182759f1f4ca85e86df",
      "text": "N-no...! Please don't mind me,\ngo and rest! You have work\ntomorrow, don't you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "143": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:326398070f7e4cdc352c62c0ae4d434777c60d3d3b0ab2df1a034c251de74e73",
      "text": "That's right. First I must make\nFather and Mother some tea!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "146": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fd912da80daebc7557e57f6a11c6a339efa609dae18b3bf086bcda321ae1caea",
      "text": "A-are you all right, Pene?\nDidn't you use your power\nto help these people...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "149": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:97f497c5ea1fe4022b6a0fc15eaeaebdfe4a8cafbf7310cef644394b2a334284",
      "text": "Yes! I lifted their carriage, up,\nup, up! And they thanked me!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "153": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7d5fe39c1cd56d9aaddaa2218d064e89330d89292eec6d868bb128947e24ddac",
      "text": "Excuse me, but since when has she\nhad this power...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "156": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:924a0c4f30bbcda59de89d43b9b282749c69582682a6923c5958f95a77455e60",
      "text": "About half a year ago, I think. Quite\nsuddenly, she could float things, and\nherself.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "157": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bf89d999afe3185da8be9d5c84fc212c7317ceb1545e72783a23cb4ffa28bc63",
      "text": "We have no such power ourselves. So\nwe worry it may be harming her mind\nand body, or burdening her.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "160": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:753d36da95cdf9339c72ed82cc4cd88b840be499ae22a3be9614de74f3966cc2",
      "text": "I'm fine! See, I'm perfectly well!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "164": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a49401c4a979e4d1d67deed46953792c22029f2aae8b46a4d6f4e8a7d2410f98",
      "text": "...Um. Maybe we could help, even if\nonly a little.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "169": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dc02e73f5620a765ae8d00f8de8b6cdfbec0f405dc8625a04dd1b5391f2cc375",
      "text": "At our base there are people with\npowers like hers. They might teach\nher how to live with her ability.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "173": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1a4a48f81f2bdfba4613196422e4799b716739a41965358804bf9ee7efa1522e",
      "text": "There are people with powers like\nmine...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "177": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:08e387cee95e25e8c8f3aacecfdbca0588704059a236e679343af5f1a944f53d",
      "text": "The thing is, our base is quite far.\nIt would just be an option, if you\nfeel like it...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "182": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:45fccecadbe77d1f9cca60eddcefe85c82ca12a2ac77e3c91cb35da613dcbf9f",
      "text": "...Thank you. It sounds very\ninteresting, but my husband and I\ncan't take time off work for a while.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "183": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ab59ed1f47f93530da748d10e2ade6edfc6e496836850ef8c52f1f1cc151ae90",
      "text": "Right... Sending our daughter alone\nwould certainly be worrying—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "187": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a22c251214c980d08a50ddfd8a75a19d8cedb1836c2eb53b9032ed40781a3b7c",
      "text": "I-I'll go.\nI want to go!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "190": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b63542538122ce16259a7028b94fc0fa4dca333c43536c871bfd1ec663d3fdf2",
      "text": "I'm not a child anymore. To become a\nwonderful grown-up, I can even\nstand on my own two feet!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "193": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2f9211bcac34daaa58a5d024de473024a4b9a533c227847e3de8e765eddfdf63",
      "text": "E-even if I'm apart from Father and\nMother, I, I—!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "197": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f07a6e20eaf40afe33140923681b64c3c45a21d0e0d25fe5f66f762c587bc814",
      "text": "...Sorry. I made you worry. But you\nwon't be separated from your parents,\nnot at all.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "202": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5759c723ecf7944c03bd819cda4d016c7c2aa0b796a8ccf337b118df7a220959",
      "text": "I... I won't?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "206": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a5ca236fac46ca369b1783f1e23556aed18f03c7c0a3e40178b42247bac145b7",
      "text": "Yes. Your home stays here. We'd be\nglad if you visited us when you felt\nlike it. ...How does that sound?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "210": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:83e9cbf71918b5993bb87ce2b87f24f29a60bdb9050bd0d41c46672c52d0e1e5",
      "text": "Father, Mother.\nI really do want to go.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "214": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c779b1e89c48fa5b74698230723a638982384bebb69f389a41e9394c978f9d67",
      "text": "I'll learn to master my power.\nTo become a wonderful grown-up...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "219": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:90f2d4428ad3d7952b81acd9b8ef4ea93ed6722c679c2c50aaac3fed984646cf",
      "text": "Wonderful...! I never knew a\nworld like this existed...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "222": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8533cb5dfdd8c8bdac66ced7b8b38d5dc0d80d8198a5b2d5df925fda028d3c42",
      "text": "Thank you so much! I will repay this\nkindness someday, for sure!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "225": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:62370ff41e040dde8a4f91246433c9a7b0223303187f880e34942a1fc0bb36f4",
      "text": "No need. Here, you can use your\npower as much as you like—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "231": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f8fcf29b567522ad44a39ba4413775d15a9bfd66a9d5a9dd165290cd650eadef",
      "text": "Nyaaah~!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "235": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:edaa9e1b1bb5dbe4cffbc981644674c1cd958e921df1c392a5f1df2218779e76",
      "text": "N-no, it's not what you think! This\nis, um... I-I can't stop...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "239": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a552201302389d2799c5a59c9a95132df033e4024209e1cd3ec5c6d84168b6ba",
      "text": "Uuu...! Someday I will... I will\nsurely become a wonderful grown-up!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
